    "%@ doesn’t identify itself as Mac apps do, so AutoHush can’t tell when it plays." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Sound Sources' or the menu's Ignore Another App…: the alert when the chosen app has no bundle identifier (the ID a Mac app has, which AutoHush tells apps' sound apart by); %@ is the app's name",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يعرّف %@ نفسه كما تفعل تطبيقات Mac، لذا لا يستطيع AutoHush معرفة متى يشغّل الصوت."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ no s’identifica com ho fan les apps del Mac, així que l’AutoHush no pot saber quan sona."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikace %@ se neidentifikuje jako aplikace pro Mac, takže AutoHush nepozná, kdy přehrává zvuk."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ identificerer sig ikke, som Mac-apps gør, så AutoHush kan ikke se, hvornår den afspiller lyd."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
