    "AutoHush can’t see %@’s page. Open its window, or close and reopen it, then click It’s Playing again." : {
      "comment" : "Under the step “Play something in %@” when AutoHush couldn't read the web app's page (not running, no window, or a window restored without its buttons' names); %@ is the web app",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يستطيع AutoHush رؤية صفحة %@. افتح نافذته، أو أغلقها وأعد فتحها، ثم انقر على «قيد التشغيل» مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’AutoHush no pot veure la pàgina de %@. Obre’n la finestra, o tanca-la i torna-la a obrir, i després torna a fer clic a «Està sonant»."
