    "AutoHush didn’t pause %@: the Play/Pause key would have reached another app." : {
      "comment" : "Under the step “Let AutoHush pause it”, marked failed, when AutoHush didn't press the keyboard's Play/Pause key because macOS would have sent it to another app (the one in Now Playing); the step “Pause it yourself” follows; %@ is the web app",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يوقف AutoHush %@ مؤقتًا: كان مفتاح التشغيل/الإيقاف المؤقت سيصل إلى تطبيق آخر."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’AutoHush no ha posat en pausa %@: la tecla Reproduir/Pausa hauria arribat a una altra app."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AutoHush nepozastavil aplikaci %@: klávesa Přehrát/Pozastavit by se dostala k jiné aplikaci."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
