            "value" : "AutoHush 會將 %@ 暫停片刻，然後繼續播放。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AutoHush 会将 %@ 暂停片刻，然后继续播放。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AutoHush 會將 %@ 暫停片刻，然後繼續播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AutoHush pauses %@ with Now Playing in the menu bar, which is hidden: show it in %@." : {
      "comment" : "Why the media player (added with Add an App, paused through the menu bar's Now Playing panel) couldn't be controlled; the first %@ is the player, the second where the setting is, e.g. “System Settings → Menu Bar”",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يوقف AutoHush ‏%1$@ مؤقتًا عبر «قيد التشغيل الآن» في شريط القوائم، وهو مخفي: أظهره من %2$@."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
