    "It needs Audio Recording, which AntiDot mode doesn’t use." : {
      "comment" : "Help tag and VoiceOver hint of an app added with Add an App whose Now Playing row doesn't show whether it plays, where media players are offered, dimmed while AntiDot mode is on",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يحتاج إلى تسجيل الصوت، الذي لا يستخدمه وضع AntiDot."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Necessita la gravació d’àudio, que el mode AntiDot no fa servir."
