      "comment" : "Add an App window, under “The menu bar’s Now Playing panel” when Now Playing is hidden in the menu bar (a Check Again button follows); %@ is where the setting is, e.g. “System Settings → Menu Bar”",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
