    "You have %@ to pause it and click It’s Paused." : {
      "comment" : "Under the step “Pause it yourself” while AutoHush learns a web app's controls, on a tinted line: a countdown, after which learning starts over; %@ is the time left, e.g. 0:45; “It’s Paused” is the button under it",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لديك %@ لإيقافه مؤقتًا والنقر على «متوقف مؤقتًا»."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tens %@ per posar-la en pausa i fer clic a «Està en pausa»."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
